  "pull_request": {
    "number": 862,
    "title": "Fix empty-set partition specification",
    "body": "## Summary\n\n`is_partition` placed pairwise disjointness and full coverage inside the per-part `forall`. With an empty `parts` set, that made the implication vacuously true even when `s` was nonempty, despite the union of no parts being empty.\n\nMove pairwise disjointness and the union equality outside the per-part quantifier. Add `lemma_is_partition_empty_parts` to prove that an empty family partitions `s` exactly when `s` is empty.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `cargo dv verify --package vstd_extra` — passed.\n- `make` — passed; OSTD verified 1,492 obligations with 0 errors.\n- `verusfmt --edition 2021 --check verified_libs/vstd_extra/src/set_extra.rs` — passed.\n- `git diff --check` — passed.\n",
    "bodyHTML": "<h2 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">is_partition</code> placed pairwise disjointness and full coverage inside the per-part <code class=\"notranslate\">forall</code>. With an empty <code class=\"notranslate\">parts</code> set, that made the implication vacuously true even when <code class=\"notranslate\">s</code> was nonempty, despite the union of no parts being empty.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Move pairwise disjointness and the union equality outside the per-part quantifier. Add <code class=\"notranslate\">lemma_is_partition_empty_parts</code> to prove that an empty family partitions <code class=\"notranslate\">s</code> exactly when <code class=\"notranslate\">s</code> is empty.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Verification</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">cargo dv verify --package vstd_extra</code> — passed.</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">make</code> — passed; OSTD verified 1,492 obligations with 0 errors.</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">verusfmt --edition 2021 --check verified_libs/vstd_extra/src/set_extra.rs</code> — passed.</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">git diff --check</code> — passed.</li>\n</ul>",
